Verse 1:
[D]Don’t you see my Jesus coming,
[G]See Him come in yonder [D]cloud?
[D]With ten thousand angels round Him,
[G]How they do my [A7]Jesus [D]crowd!

Refrain:
[D]I am bound for the kingdom,
[G]Will you go to glory [D]with me?
[D]Hallelujah! O [G]praise ye [A7]the [D]Lord!

Verse 2:
[D]Don't you see the saints ascending,
[G]Hear them shouting thro' the [D]air.
[D]Jesus smiling, trumpets sounding,
[G]Now His glory [A7]they shall [D]share.
